ec9b83\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45be06fe\" id=\"u45be06fe\">需要计算均值μ和方差σ²，带来额外计算开销</span></li><li fid=\"u3852f36c\" data-lake-id=\"ub37de62d\" id=\"ub37de62d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98441786\" id=\"u98441786\">在长文本序列中容易出现内部协变量偏移</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u23e9e8c0\" id=\"u23e9e8c0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8d378b47\" id=\"u8d378b47\">RMSNorm的创新设计</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0402b8d8\" id=\"u0402b8d8\">：</span></p><ul list=\"u642ecd01\"><li fid=\"u76cbe93b\" data-lake-id=\"ufa31fd6e\" id=\"ufa31fd6e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41cdcbea\" id=\"u41cdcbea\">公式简化：$</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cgamma%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BRMS%7D(x)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff897b56aba22ae67dd3932140e3e4d20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CJK2U%22%7D\"></card><span data-lake-id=\"ufb2658cb\" id=\"ufb2658cb\">$</span></li><li fid=\"u76cbe93b\" data-lake-id=\"u43347d0a\" id=\"u43347d0a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u341a069c\" id=\"u341a069c\">仅计算均方根值，减少计算量30%-50%</span></li><li fid=\"u76cbe93b\" data-lake-id=\"u2b74a736\" id=\"u2b74a736\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f431e75\" id=\"u8f431e75\">数值稳定性提升：通过指数移动平均保持动态分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u853b2c57\" id=\"u853b2c57\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u231e0e82\" id=\"u231e0e82\">工程优化实践</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u225474e5\" id=\"u225474e5\">：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22class%20RMSNorm(nn.Module)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2C%20hidden_size%2C%20eps%3D1e-6)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20super().__init__()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.eps%20%3D%20eps%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.weight%20%3D%20nn.Parameter(torch.ones(hidden_size))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20forward(self%2C%20x)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20variance%20%3D%20x.pow(2).mean(-1%2C%20keepdim%3DTrue)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20x%20%3D%20x%20*%20torch.rsqrt(variance%20%2B%20self.eps)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20self.weight%20*%20x%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eylkq%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc6f37d00\" id=\"uc6f37d00\"><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"580b803d\" id=\"580b803d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2c4d9000\" id=\"u2c4d9000\">2. SwiGLU激活函数的突破</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u14e88e60\" id=\"u14e88e60\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u73cbe04a\" id=\"u73cbe04a\">GLU门控机制的演进</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8d7de23f\" id=\"u8d7de23f\">：</span></p><ul list=\"ud9fd33c0\"><li fid=\"ucbe73dbb\" data-lake-id=\"ud3263cf9\" id=\"ud3263cf9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36368092\" id=\"u36368092\">基础GLU公式：</span><span data-lake-id=\"ueb7ba238\" id=\"ueb7ba238\">$$\\text{GLU}(a, b) = a \\otimes \\sigma(b)$$</span></li><li fid=\"ucbe73dbb\" data-lake-id=\"u3703e04b\" id=\"u3703e04b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u335d55eb\" id=\"u335d55eb\">参数效率问题：需要独立训练a和b的参数矩阵</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uf354a3b0\" id=\"uf354a3b0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud3ce7801\" id=\"ud3ce7801\">SwiGLU的创新设计</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue24bc71b\" id=\"ue24bc71b\">：</span></p><ul list=\"u6f4625fe\"><li fid=\"u029fb119\" data-lake-id=\"ua15dabfd\" id=\"ua15dabfd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9dbbe9c6\" id=\"u9dbbe9c6\">数学形式：</span><span data-lake-id=\"u674b74e9\" id=\"u674b74e9\">$$\\text{SwiGLU}(x) = x \\cdot \\sigma(W_2 \\cdot \\delta(W_1 x))$$</span></li><li fid=\"u029fb119\" data-lake-id=\"u48f56b05\" id=\"u48f56b05\"><span data-lake-id=\"u037a7ff7\" id=\"u037a7ff7\">参数共享：将输入维度压缩为原来的1/2</span></li><li fid=\"u029fb119\" data-lake-id=\"u4498a55d\" id=\"u4498a55d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65f622c5\" id=\"u65f622c5\">非线性增强：引入SiLU激活函数提升表达能力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u1376f06c\" id=\"u1376f06c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u03410470\" id=\"u03410470\">性能对比实验</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud591f6cd\" id=\"ud591f6cd\">：</span></p><table data-lake-id=\"gquRW\" id=\"gquRW\" margin=\"true\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 748px\"><colgroup><col width=\"187\"><col width=\"187\"><col width=\"187\"><col width=\"187\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u578149c3\" id=\"u578149c3\"><td data-lake-id=\"u361cef2f\" id=\"u361cef2f\"><p data-lake-id=\"ucf060290\" id=\"ucf060290\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c6555dc\" id=\"u9c6555dc\">模型架构</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u268e2932\" id=\"u268e2932\"><p data-lake-id=\"ue7cd843a\" id=\"ue7cd843a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc2b3b61c\" id=\"uc2b3b61c\">参数量</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u36589d6d\" id=\"u36589d6d\"><p data-lake-id=\"u396fb071\" id=\"u396fb071\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75f7e178\" id=\"u75f7e178\">训练速度</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u60f2730a\" id=\"u60f2730a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1aa9a76a\" id=\"u1aa9a76a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8907b7be\" id=\"u8907b7be\">Test Accuracy</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u586f4089\" id=\"u586f4089\"><td data-lake-id=\"u6c1e745a\" id=\"u6c1e745a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u676ccead\" id=\"u676ccead\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6234c598\" id=\"u6234c598\">Transformer-MLP</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u1f1e04c7\" id=\"u1f1e04c7\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub745d3fc\" id=\"ub745d3fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u82c8cd05\" id=\"u82c8cd05\">100M</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u7139103f\" id=\"u7139103f\"><p data-lake-id=\"udbd416d1\" id=\"udbd416d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf997f8d\" id=\"ucf997f8d\">1.2s/iter</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uc05113a1\" id=\"uc05113a1\"><p data-lake-id=\"u6fc5becd\" id=\"u6fc5becd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5523ee5f\" id=\"u5523ee5f\">89.2%</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u115e3d4a\" id=\"u11